# DELTA Installer Configuration

# DELTA_VERSION is intentionally duplicated with lib\DeltaInstaller.Version.ps1
# ($Script:DeltaInstallerVersion), not derived from it. That file remains the
# sole AUTHORITATIVE source - it is what setup.ps1 actually displays/registers,
# and .github\workflows\release.yml dot-sources it in complete isolation (no
# Configuration.ps1, no .env.installer) to gate releases against the pushed Git
# tag, so it cannot be made to depend on this file. DELTA_VERSION here is not
# currently read by any script; it exists for future diagnostics/installer
# reporting (see lib\DeltaInstaller.Configuration.ps1). Keep both values in
# sync by hand when bumping the installer version.
DELTA_VERSION=1.0.3

NODE_VERSION=24.18.0
NODE_INSTALLER=node-v24.18.0-x64.msi
NODE_URL=https://nodejs.org/dist/v24.18.0/node-v24.18.0-x64.msi

POSTGRES_VERSION=17.6
POSTGRES_INSTALLER=postgresql-17.6-1-windows-x64.exe
POSTGRES_URL=https://get.enterprisedb.com/postgresql/postgresql-17.6-1-windows-x64.exe

POSTGIS_VERSION=3.6.2
POSTGIS_INSTALLER=postgis-bundle-pg17x64-setup-3.6.2-1.exe
POSTGIS_URL=https://download.osgeo.org/postgis/windows/pg17/postgis-bundle-pg17x64-setup-3.6.2-1.exe

NGINX_VERSION=1.29.2
NGINX_INSTALLER=nginx-1.29.2.zip
NGINX_URL=https://nginx.org/download/nginx-1.29.2.zip

# WinSW (Windows Service Wrapper) - supervises the deployed DELTA Node.js
# process as the DeltaApp Windows Service (lib\DeltaInstaller.Service.ps1).
#
# The .NET Framework 4.6.1 build is deliberate: it is 656 KB, versus ~18 MB
# for the self-contained WinSW-x64.exe, and .NET Framework 4.6.1+ ships with
# Windows Server 2022/2025 and Windows 11, so it needs no runtime install.
#
# WINSW_INSTALLER is the LOCAL cache filename, not the published asset name
# (which carries no version) - keeping the version in the cached filename is
# what lets a future version bump download alongside the old one instead of
# silently reusing a stale cache entry, the same way NODE_INSTALLER already
# does.
#
# WINSW_SHA256 is MANDATORY, not optional convenience: the published WinSW
# binaries are NOT Authenticode-signed (verified directly), so this digest is
# the only integrity guarantee available. A mismatch is fatal - see
# Get-DeltaWinSwBinary.
WINSW_VERSION=2.12.0
WINSW_INSTALLER=WinSW-2.12.0-NET461.exe
WINSW_URL=https://github.com/winsw/winsw/releases/download/v2.12.0/WinSW.NET461.exe
WINSW_SHA256=B5066B7BBDFBA1293E5D15CDA3CAAEA88FBEAB35BD5B38C41C913D492AADFC4F
